<title>USA: Union Texas files $500 mln shelf offering.</title>
<headline>Union Texas files $500 mln shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Texas Petroleum Holdings Inc filed Thursday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $500 million of debt securities, common stock, preferred shares, depositary shares and warrants.</p>
<p>The Houston-based oil and gas company said proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes, which may include repaying outstanding debt, funding working capital needs and capital expenditures.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
